## 9. SETUP-SPECIFIC NEGATIVE RULES

| # | Negative Rule | Source GPS | Severity |
|---|--------------|------------|----------|
| 1 | **Do NOT use VWAP for counter-trades without trend context.** "if we were to use the VWAP as a tool that we simply always use for counter trading, then I'd have 7 million stop losses here." | 43JaKHRvxHk [BEGINNING] | [BLOCKED] CRITICAL |
| 2 | **Do NOT enter a counter-trade too early before proof.** "many people get wrong again and again and enter such trades far too early" / "if we had already entered the market here we would have been stopped out. Plain and simple that's just the truth" | zQTbdEweG3c [BEGINNING] + BVpYGKz9PBU [MIDDLE] | [BLOCKED] CRITICAL |
| 3 | **Do NOT trade trend-continuation when market is sideways/balanced.** "in a sequence like this, you mustn't trade a trend continuation. You absolutely have to go for counter trades." | 43JaKHRvxHk [MIDDLE] | [BLOCKED] CRITICAL |
| 4 | **Do NOT scalp when VWAP is trending.** "Only if the VWAP is currently oriented sideways... then I can use this whole model for myself." | 43JaKHRvxHk [MIDDLE] | [BLOCKED] CRITICAL |
| 5 | **Do NOT confuse setup types.** "you absolutely have to divide your setups that are suitable for short trades into counter trend continuation or breakout. And this is exactly where the wheat is separated from the chaff" | BVpYGKz9PBU [MIDDLE] | [BLOCKED] CRITICAL |
| 6 | **Do NOT counter-trade against the trend without many parameters.** "If you make trades against the trend, then you need many, many parameters that speak in your favor." | zQTbdEweG3c [BEGINNING] | [BLOCKED] CRITICAL |
| 7 | **Do NOT assume balance profile after trend means going short.** "That doesn't mean it's going short yet. It can just as easily continue long." | zQTbdEweG3c [MIDDLE] | [BLOCKED] CRITICAL |
